  "description": "Version public: WPF styles and controls library\n\n\t\t\tRelease Notes (v1.2.0):\n\t\t\t- Added new UCBar control for custom window title bar\n\t\t\t- Added new FooterBar control with social media links\n\t\t\t- Enhanced DataGrid UI with improved colors and styling\n\t\t\t- Improved DataGrid scrolling behavior - now supports mouse wheel scrolling anywhere in the grid\n\t\t\t- Added new color scheme based on mint and teal palette\n\t\t\t- Fixed various UI/UX issues\n\n\t\t\tFor documentation and examples, please visit the project website.",
